WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:27.694 --> 00:00:28.278
Shhh...

00:00:28.278 --> 00:00:31.364
♪ Could you hear that? ♪

00:00:31.531 --> 00:00:36.828
♪ No, no, you've got to listen closer. ♪

00:00:38.371 --> 00:00:40.874
♪ The Dandelion speaks. ♪

00:00:41.416 --> 00:00:46.796
♪ Don't laugh, she's got some things to teach us. ♪ 

00:00:47.797 --> 00:00:51.259
♪ It's the small things like us. ♪

00:00:51.259 --> 00:00:57.348
♪ We come together to make big things. ♪

00:00:57.640 --> 00:00:59.559
♪ Like the baseball game. ♪

00:01:01.019 --> 00:01:05.940
♪ It's not just one it's everyone. ♪

00:01:06.107 --> 00:01:08.318
♪ And to be fair ♪

00:01:08.818 --> 00:01:11.863
♪ we don't own this ground, ♪ 

00:01:12.155 --> 00:01:13.948
♪ Charlie Brown. ♪

00:01:15.700 --> 00:01:17.577
♪ We share it. ♪

00:01:17.869 --> 00:01:25.418
♪ So whoa up!  Slow down! There's life on the mound? Can you hear the sound? ♪

00:01:26.544 --> 00:01:31.007
♪ It's the small things, Charlie Brown. ♪

00:01:31.925 --> 00:01:40.225
♪ Can't you see yoursef right there. That's you, alone, you're a lonely flower. ♪

00:01:41.643 --> 00:01:50.026
♪ But a field of us you know. We make a team and that's our power ♪

00:01:50.026 --> 00:02:01.621
♪ so be aware of where you step and what and who you might be stepping on. ♪

00:02:02.247 --> 00:02:09.504
♪ Look up. Look now. So huge. So wow. Let me break it down. ♪

00:02:10.380 --> 00:02:14.551
♪ Little droplets make big clouds. ♪

00:02:15.385 --> 00:02:20.014
♪  It's the small things, Charlie Brown. ♪

00:02:21.182 --> 00:02:27.355
♪ Lots and lots of the tiniest dots can make shapes. ♪

00:02:27.689 --> 00:02:32.110
♪ Even faces when viewed far away. ♪

00:02:32.610 --> 00:02:39.909
♪ And the quietest voice can cut through the noise. ♪

00:02:39.909 --> 00:02:43.288
♪ When you're speaking...♪

00:02:44.956 --> 00:02:45.748
♪ The truth. ♪

00:02:51.212 --> 00:02:53.256
♪ Look up. Look down. ♪

00:02:53.423 --> 00:02:55.758
♪ The sky and the ground. ♪

00:02:55.758 --> 00:02:57.969
♪  Getting louder now. ♪

00:02:59.512 --> 00:03:03.224
♪ The voice of the bravest flower. ♪

00:03:04.225 --> 00:03:08.313
♪ Too small to hear without. ♪

00:03:09.063 --> 00:03:12.984
♪ Some perspective Charlie Brown. ♪

00:03:14.110 --> 00:03:20.783
♪ Do the right thing. Are you with me Charlie Brown? ♪

